      "content": "but a tiny step doesn't stop the water from rising. it's just a way to delay the inevitable. i'm just so tired of fighting for a life that's just going to be one big struggle to pay for mistakes i can't even fix. honestly, it feels like the only way to actually stop the pressure and just be done with it is to find an exit. is there any other way out when the math is this broken?",
